WEBVTT

00:01.465 --> 00:03.895
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:03.935 --> 00:07.065
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:07.465 --> 00:10.195
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:10.235 --> 00:14.935
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:15.345 --> 00:23.375
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:23.855 --> 00:26.875
Dragon Drive

00:26.955 --> 00:32.395
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:32.765 --> 00:35.425
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:35.465 --> 00:38.995
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:39.165 --> 00:43.535
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:43.575 --> 00:45.505
ima mo
I'd still...

00:45.545 --> 00:51.965
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:53.615 --> 00:55.945
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:55.985 --> 00:59.215
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

00:59.525 --> 01:04.395
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:04.425 --> 01:06.155
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:06.195 --> 01:08.625
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:08.665 --> 01:11.865
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:12.165 --> 01:16.965
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:17.305 --> 01:19.865
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:20.105 --> 01:27.445
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:39.765 --> 01:41.255
Here I go!

01:41.295 --> 01:43.825
Dude, I thought maybe you were planning
to run away alone again.

01:48.405 --> 01:49.165
Rockaku.

01:49.505 --> 01:53.165
I wanted to become
Rikyu's strongest, with you.

01:53.205 --> 01:56.605
I'll have no problem finishing you off alone!

01:57.215 --> 01:58.175
Now, Mukai!

01:58.345 --> 02:01.115
Guan-Coo! Take this!

02:05.225 --> 02:06.885
How dare you give me orders?!

02:09.455 --> 02:12.185
We're now entering the final stage.

02:14.125 --> 02:17.185
The End of Revenge

02:17.565 --> 02:18.895
You must stop!

02:18.935 --> 02:20.695
If you violate the will of the gods
any further...

02:20.765 --> 02:22.795
...you will make the gods angry!

02:23.235 --> 02:26.205
I don't believe in any gods.

02:27.175 --> 02:29.505
In the meantime, this guy
will be your opponent.

02:39.285 --> 02:41.415
Thanks, Darks.

02:57.945 --> 02:59.335
Why don't we get going?

02:59.605 --> 03:00.875
Stop right there!

03:12.125 --> 03:14.315
Hey. You're still here.

03:14.625 --> 03:16.925
I will defeat you, no matter what!

03:17.155 --> 03:18.495
Even if it costs me my life!

03:20.265 --> 03:21.425
Then I suggest you die.

03:38.815 --> 03:40.505
He's already weak as it is.

03:40.545 --> 03:42.245
Losing his head doesn't help him one bit.

03:57.905 --> 03:59.295
Thank you, Reiji.

04:00.305 --> 04:01.395
Not a problem.

04:01.775 --> 04:03.965
More importantly, what will you do now?

04:05.145 --> 04:08.835
I must recover as soon as possible,
and rebuild my nation.

04:11.585 --> 04:13.135
For the sake of my departed mother.

04:15.685 --> 04:19.625
Then when the time comes,
please invite us and treat us to a feast!

04:19.855 --> 04:20.945
Daisuke!

04:22.025 --> 04:23.355
What's wrong with that?!

04:23.395 --> 04:26.195
We're talking about Mukai,
he can rebuild his nation easily!

04:31.565 --> 04:35.365
Then I'll have a bowl of pork cutlet on rice,
with two plates of pudding!

04:37.035 --> 04:38.025
Oh, boy.

04:38.205 --> 04:40.575
If you're gonna ask anyway,
why not ask for a real feast?

04:40.705 --> 04:41.975
You're such a commoner.

04:46.945 --> 04:49.215
I'm glad that I was able to meet you people.

04:50.715 --> 04:51.915
Did you say something?

04:52.155 --> 04:52.885
No.

04:54.255 --> 04:56.225
Do you mind if I get a little sleep?

04:56.425 --> 04:57.325
Go ahead.

04:57.355 --> 04:58.455
Then I'll...

04:58.495 --> 04:59.965
...do... exactly...

04:59.995 --> 05:01.395
...that.

05:06.305 --> 05:07.295
Chibi.

05:11.675 --> 05:14.805
By the way, I wonder how things turned out
at the Dragonic Heaven.

05:15.775 --> 05:18.615
That's right, we left Rockaku alone
and came here.

05:24.725 --> 05:27.185
Reiji and the others still haven't returned?

05:27.925 --> 05:29.895
To think that we lost without even fighting.

05:30.595 --> 05:32.895
I can understand their hatred
toward Guan-Coo...

05:32.995 --> 05:35.195
...but the resulting damage
to us is too great.

05:36.195 --> 05:39.165
We've thrown away
the one chance we had.

05:43.835 --> 05:45.705
Elder. Look.

05:45.945 --> 05:47.675
The gods' spirits have been broken?!

05:48.175 --> 05:49.165
No!

05:49.645 --> 05:52.805
At this rate, the Dragonite
will be taken to Earth!

06:07.725 --> 06:09.785
That's the gateway to Earth.

06:11.505 --> 06:14.335
Should RI-ON get their hands
on the Dragonite...

06:14.735 --> 06:18.395
...it may mark the end to worlds
across all dimensions.

06:23.875 --> 06:25.875
Meguru! Where are you going?!

06:27.715 --> 06:29.415
Until Reiji and the others get here...

06:29.455 --> 06:31.355
...there's no choice
but for me to do my best.

06:31.855 --> 06:33.155
That's about all...

06:33.625 --> 06:34.855
...that I can do.

06:38.195 --> 06:41.565
You know, this looks like
nothing but a useless rock to me.

06:41.835 --> 06:42.815
Kouhei.

06:43.095 --> 06:44.655
Are you taking that back with you?

06:45.035 --> 06:47.295
Yeah. What're you guys gonna do?

06:47.905 --> 06:49.875
If you're returning, now would be the time.

06:50.135 --> 06:53.905
You never know what I'll do with this
once I'm on the other side!

06:54.975 --> 06:56.065
I'm staying.

06:56.115 --> 06:57.075
Me, too.

06:57.645 --> 07:00.305
I'm not interested in Earth or the Dragonite.

07:01.185 --> 07:03.115
There's only one thing I'm interested in!

07:12.495 --> 07:14.325
Aside from it, I have no reason to live.

07:14.525 --> 07:16.695
I have some loose ends to tie
while I'm here.

07:17.195 --> 07:19.755
What could be important enough
to keep you from returning to Earth?!

07:21.435 --> 07:22.805
It's none of your business!

07:22.975 --> 07:24.525
Well, not that I care.

07:32.445 --> 07:35.075
Please. Go and look for Meguru.

07:36.885 --> 07:38.645
- Huh? But...
- I know.

07:38.855 --> 07:41.155
As far as RI-ON's concerned,
she's a traitor.

07:42.655 --> 07:43.645
But...

07:44.725 --> 07:46.315
...to me...

07:47.325 --> 07:49.425
...she's my one and only sister.

07:56.605 --> 07:58.435
Well, whatever happens, don't blame me.

08:11.015 --> 08:13.575
Have you come all the way here
to let me beat up on you?

08:14.685 --> 08:17.085
What?! He has the Dragonite?!

08:17.455 --> 08:19.755
Meguru's gone alone to stop him!

08:19.895 --> 08:20.885
That's crazy!

08:21.065 --> 08:22.895
- Let's go, Reiji!
- Right!

08:22.895 --> 08:24.365
Elder! Please take care of Mukai!

08:28.105 --> 08:29.435
What will you do?

08:29.735 --> 08:30.725
I...

08:30.875 --> 08:32.845
...I'm sick and tired of battling!

08:33.345 --> 08:35.605
But I guess not enough to keep me back.

08:37.915 --> 08:39.035
I'll go!

08:39.245 --> 08:42.275
I can't just sit back and let a guy like that
have things go his way!

08:53.665 --> 08:54.655
Please.

08:54.865 --> 08:57.265
We must stop him no matter what!

08:58.135 --> 09:00.825
If that power gets into
the hands of RI-ON...

09:01.475 --> 09:03.065
...both Rikyu and Earth...

09:03.575 --> 09:05.735
...will be led into an age of darkness!

09:14.585 --> 09:16.745
The cuts are deeper than I thought.

09:57.825 --> 09:59.625
I'm not about to let you return!

10:00.365 --> 10:01.955
No matter what!

10:02.595 --> 10:04.895
You're crying over something like that?

10:07.065 --> 10:08.295
Since I'm bored...

10:09.505 --> 10:10.475
...I'll fight you!

10:26.185 --> 10:28.485
You're not getting away, kid!

10:38.035 --> 10:39.005
Rockaku!

10:40.105 --> 10:42.065
Are you in love with me or something?

10:42.105 --> 10:43.865
You're so persistent!

10:43.935 --> 10:45.065
Get serious!

10:45.545 --> 10:47.375
You're the one...

10:48.205 --> 10:50.105
...who killed my friend, Yakou!

10:50.975 --> 10:51.965
Yakou?

10:52.545 --> 10:54.515
I don't remember him at all.

10:55.155 --> 10:58.015
That person must've been really weak!

10:58.285 --> 10:59.875
Bastard!

11:06.695 --> 11:07.825
What's so funny?!

11:10.095 --> 11:14.125
Whaddaya say I test the powers
of this thing?

11:14.335 --> 11:15.205
What?!

11:42.435 --> 11:44.555
Oh, no!

11:47.965 --> 11:49.565
Wow.

11:50.535 --> 11:53.065
This thing has some incredible powers.

11:53.605 --> 11:55.265
Awesome!

11:57.575 --> 11:58.565
Go!

12:05.325 --> 12:06.305
What?!

12:13.765 --> 12:15.025
What's wrong?

12:15.395 --> 12:17.795
I thought you were gonna avenge your friend.

12:18.265 --> 12:22.635
Now that I've been given
the title of Number One in Rikyu...

12:22.735 --> 12:26.505
...you gotta defeat all of Rikyu's dragons
to earn the right to fight me.

12:27.145 --> 12:29.505
You don't hafta tell me! I'll do it!

12:33.785 --> 12:34.775
Rockaku!

12:44.825 --> 12:47.095
I can't die here!

12:47.825 --> 12:49.355
I cannot!

12:50.235 --> 12:51.395
I can't!

13:00.005 --> 13:00.705
What?!

13:00.745 --> 13:02.935
Stop showing off all alone, Rockaku!

13:09.085 --> 13:10.385
Are you all right, Meguru?!

13:10.585 --> 13:12.215
M-Maiko!

13:12.255 --> 13:13.515
Give me a break.

13:14.785 --> 13:16.655
No fair, taking the spotlight in our absence.

13:19.825 --> 13:21.595
Okay! Let's do it!

13:21.895 --> 13:22.525
Yeah!

13:22.565 --> 13:23.555
Wait!

13:23.595 --> 13:25.125
You guys stay back!

13:25.335 --> 13:26.265
I'll...

13:27.035 --> 13:29.125
...I'll defeat him on my own!

13:29.175 --> 13:30.335
Rockaku!

13:31.675 --> 13:33.805
It's meaningless unless I do it.

13:34.745 --> 13:36.265
With my own hands!

13:38.145 --> 13:39.805
Yakou! Yakou!

13:40.115 --> 13:42.645
Yakou!

13:44.015 --> 13:47.115
I've been waiting for this moment
ever since that day.

13:47.785 --> 13:49.515
I've lived to this day...

13:50.325 --> 13:52.585
...for this moment!

13:55.935 --> 13:56.915
Get him!

14:08.745 --> 14:10.835
I'm telling you to stop!

14:11.115 --> 14:13.135
I'll destroy him without anyone's help!

14:13.385 --> 14:15.505
Who said we're lending you a hand?!

14:20.485 --> 14:22.615
We're just doing this on our own...

14:23.125 --> 14:25.055
...to try to get the Dragonite back!

14:25.825 --> 14:26.695
That's right!

14:26.725 --> 14:28.215
And while we're doing this, Rockaku...

14:28.695 --> 14:29.425
Right.

14:29.595 --> 14:31.565
Why don't you go and defeat him?!

14:31.735 --> 14:32.705
Exactly!

14:35.175 --> 14:35.935
Hey!

14:35.975 --> 14:39.565
You'd better hurry,
or I'll end up defeating Kouhei instead!

14:40.245 --> 14:41.235
Guys.

14:43.575 --> 14:44.945
Do as you wish!

14:50.915 --> 14:53.515
Okay, everyone look here!

14:54.325 --> 14:56.055
That light forming a circle...

14:56.225 --> 14:58.695
...is a gateway to Earth!

14:59.495 --> 15:01.295
But even though it's open now...

15:01.935 --> 15:04.455
...it's gonna close in exactly three minutes!

15:05.335 --> 15:09.035
In other words, if you succeed in
keeping me here for another three minutes...

15:09.735 --> 15:11.565
...I cannot return to Earth!

15:12.245 --> 15:14.805
And that would mean you guys win!

15:16.875 --> 15:19.315
Whaddaya say? Wanna challenge me?

15:20.485 --> 15:22.145
There's nothing to decide!

15:22.585 --> 15:25.075
I have no intention to back away
from you, anyway!

15:25.285 --> 15:26.375
It's no use.

15:26.425 --> 15:27.755
You gotta try harder than that!

15:39.335 --> 15:41.325
D-Damn you.

15:53.685 --> 15:54.845
M-Mukai!

15:56.455 --> 15:58.005
Move aside. Don't get in my way.

15:58.285 --> 16:01.725
I know exactly how you feel
for the friend who passed away.

16:02.525 --> 16:05.155
I, too, fought for my late mother.

16:05.795 --> 16:07.315
And that's why I tell you this!

16:07.665 --> 16:11.685
Think hard about what is most important
to you right now!

16:15.775 --> 16:16.895
Shut up.

16:16.935 --> 16:20.205
The most important thing
is for me to defeat this guy!

16:20.445 --> 16:21.235
You're wrong!

16:22.615 --> 16:26.775
I thought hard about what would
make my mother in heaven most happy.

16:27.245 --> 16:29.045
I thought about it for a long time.

16:29.485 --> 16:31.215
After giving it great thought...

16:31.555 --> 16:33.615
...I joined forces with Reiji and fought.

16:34.285 --> 16:36.225
If you injured yourself fighting recklessly...

16:36.455 --> 16:38.755
...or got killed trying to get revenge...

16:39.225 --> 16:41.215
...would that make Reiji
and the others happy?!

16:48.165 --> 16:49.765
I don't intend to get killed!

16:49.805 --> 16:50.775
However...

16:50.805 --> 16:52.895
...if I lost my life in order to defeat this guy...

16:52.945 --> 16:54.465
...that's a trade I'd be satisfied with!

16:54.605 --> 16:56.445
You're getting on my nerves.

16:56.875 --> 16:57.865
Disappear, already!

17:03.485 --> 17:04.475
Mukai!

17:19.965 --> 17:20.835
Mukai!

17:20.865 --> 17:22.525
Hang on! Hey!

17:27.905 --> 17:29.175
What is it?

17:39.385 --> 17:40.375
Did we do it?!

17:53.635 --> 17:56.295
If you guys take your time with this...

17:56.335 --> 17:58.305
...I'll be off to Earth, you know.

18:03.215 --> 18:07.445
There must be a way to get past
this wall of dragons and closer to Kouhei.

18:08.985 --> 18:10.715
There must be a path to victory.

18:11.655 --> 18:12.645
A path!

18:13.025 --> 18:14.985
Hey, everyone! I need your help!

18:15.625 --> 18:18.285
Have you thought of a plan or something
to wipe that guy out?!

18:18.525 --> 18:19.425
Yeah!

18:19.465 --> 18:21.015
Then let me be part of it!

18:23.495 --> 18:24.595
Rockaku!

18:24.665 --> 18:26.225
I'll apply the finishing blow!

18:29.005 --> 18:29.995
Okay!

18:30.475 --> 18:33.205
Let's build up our energy!

18:33.275 --> 18:34.465
Right!

18:52.295 --> 18:54.155
You're combining your powers?

18:54.325 --> 18:56.195
You guys come up with the cheesiest plans.

18:57.265 --> 18:59.195
Your three minutes are almost up.

19:00.305 --> 19:01.795
Let's do it, everyone!

19:02.475 --> 19:03.455
Yeah!

19:03.735 --> 19:06.205
Go, Rockaku!

19:19.025 --> 19:20.285
Look at that!

19:20.485 --> 19:22.115
Even with all of your powers together...

19:22.295 --> 19:24.815
...you couldn't even scratch me!

19:41.105 --> 19:42.635
Gotcha, kid!

19:49.355 --> 19:51.015
How d'you like our friendship-power?!

19:51.455 --> 19:53.285
It sounds so cheesy when you say it.

19:53.425 --> 19:54.215
Cheesy?

19:54.385 --> 19:55.655
Well, Kouhei?!

19:55.695 --> 19:57.385
Your three minutes are up!

19:57.755 --> 19:59.785
You have no way outta here!

20:04.995 --> 20:06.995
It's awesome to have friends.

20:07.465 --> 20:09.735
It's important to have trust in one another!

20:10.535 --> 20:12.305
At your level, that is!

20:19.985 --> 20:22.915
Boy! I'm glad I stayed around
to experience that!

20:29.055 --> 20:30.455
The gateway's still open!

20:30.795 --> 20:32.695
He was hiding it with the other dragons!

20:35.665 --> 20:37.225
That was a lot of fun.

20:38.035 --> 20:39.125
Nice work!

20:39.335 --> 20:41.895
That thing about only having
three minutes was a lie?!

20:50.945 --> 20:52.415
B-Bastard!

20:53.385 --> 20:54.375
Rockaku!

20:57.385 --> 20:58.545
Are you all right?

21:00.785 --> 21:01.915
Kouhei!

21:02.855 --> 21:05.515
Kouhei!

21:15.805 --> 21:16.995
Th-This can't be happening.

21:17.105 --> 21:18.735
Mukai is...

21:19.475 --> 21:20.945
...dead?

21:21.775 --> 21:23.605
You must pave the way to the future...

21:23.745 --> 21:25.375
...for the sake of those who have passed on.

21:26.245 --> 21:28.235
With your new friends.

21:56.075 --> 21:58.675
taikutsu datta
I was bored

21:58.715 --> 22:01.475
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:01.515 --> 22:05.385
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:06.885 --> 22:09.615
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:09.655 --> 22:12.215
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:12.265 --> 22:16.425
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:17.865 --> 22:20.495
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:20.535 --> 22:22.695
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:23.205 --> 22:27.435
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:28.545 --> 22:31.475
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:31.515 --> 22:33.505
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:34.045 --> 22:39.045
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:39.625 --> 22:42.285
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:42.325 --> 22:45.015
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:45.055 --> 22:49.725
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:50.535 --> 22:53.195
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:53.235 --> 22:55.865
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:55.905 --> 23:00.735
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:01.245 --> 23:05.675
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:06.685 --> 23:12.345
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:14.785 --> 23:17.415
Next time

23:17.455 --> 23:18.785
What'll we do?!

23:18.825 --> 23:20.955
He's gone off with the Dragonite!

23:20.995 --> 23:22.015
Couldn't be worse!

23:22.065 --> 23:23.155
But we mustn't give up!

23:23.235 --> 23:26.025
I'll try to get the Dragonite back,
no matter what!

23:26.065 --> 23:27.965
Never give up!

23:28.065 --> 23:29.195
Okay!

23:29.275 --> 23:31.065
Then why don't we look back
at how we got here...

23:31.105 --> 23:33.365
...and come up with a plan?!

23:34.605 --> 23:37.075
Next, on Dragon Drive, "The Journey".

23:38.315 --> 23:40.745
Looking back, all sorts of memories pop up.

23:40.915 --> 23:41.615
We went through a lot!

23:41.615 --> 23:43.385
The Journey
We went through a lot!

23:43.385 --> 23:44.515
The Journey
Learn from our mistakes.
